    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >clan fantasy adventures is a turn-based 2D RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game controle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game can be play only with keyboard and mouse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A : talk, do actions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >direction key : to move</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TAB : open menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Z : cancel action (in fight)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Marco, a young boy who wants to become a swordsman and his mage friend Vard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During one of their mission, they will encounter a metamorph of the wolf clan with serious wound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But by helping him, they will put themself into a major conflict between several country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel the world to gain new allies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your allies to learn new techniques.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight enemies in turn-based battles</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >clan fantasy adventures is a turn-based 2D RPG.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game controle</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game can be play only with keyboard and mouse</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A : talk, do actions</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >direction key : to move</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >TAB : open menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Z : cancel action (in fight)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Story</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play Marco, a young boy who wants to become a swordsman and his mage friend Vard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During one of their mission, they will encounter a metamorph of the wolf clan with serious wound.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But by helping him, they will put themself into a major conflict between several country.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Travel the world to gain new allies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your allies to learn new techniques.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight enemies in turn-based battles</p></li></ul>",
